    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 14th level, your mere presence is enough to sweep most off their feet. Your aura increases to 30 ft. When you grant a creature a Bardic Inspiration while within your aura, each creature of your choice also gains a Bardic Inspiration (at no extra cost).</p>\n<p>In addition, each creature of your choice within your aura gains a bonus to their saving throws equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum of 1) while you are conscious.</p>",
